ne Cernan test-drives the Apollo 17 lunar rover shortly after unloading it from the LM Challenger.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ANASA_Apollo_17_Lunar_Roving_Vehicle.jpg"}],"sounds":{}}}